e": "2560 1440.png", "id": "1077341404090196", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75540508_1077341407423529_4511965539534469614_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S7svCghyRkgQ7kNvwGgEIvu&_nc_oc=AdpBmdaRx90G4QRfuaLjvyRgwsxFOOirWtyO7MZG4fYer0yQZP9kIyQaM5lUu-C-_F4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS3j7lme-xZLoQ3glLRfhiHeLIHLjoEDNkt8LWQx7U0Vw&oe=6B0B21CB"}, "display_name": "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QN_Pd6y6clIQ7kNvwFqna-f&_nc_oc=AdpBoLHymVKTU7o_c2DNfmj18Tf98Qr0XO14C5znA74R_0TzIHUXGZWsXRuqEZ4rI00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQReIC4XqmORpL6pPPeJCojr8ipL1gvWUg2hSHvoLxJxnQ&oe=6B0B1549"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc